Visitors 0.7 (web log analyzer by Salvatore Sanfilippo) for Sentora on Ubuntu 26.04

0.7 is the last release. Ubuntu no longer packages it, so the installer builds it
from this source into /usr/local/bin/visitors.

visitors_0.7.orig.tar.gz   upstream source, from the Ubuntu archive
patches/ (Debian 0.7-9)    browser list update, combined log maps, man page,
                           build flags
patches/90_escape_links    Sentora: escape logged URLs inside report links
                           (a quote could otherwise add attributes to a link)

